.TH SAMPLE 1
.SH NAME
sample \- Shows the sample's state.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsample\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the sample's state.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print what would change.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBconfig\fR
Shows the configuration.
See \fBsample\-config\fR(1).
.TP
\fBconfig get\fR
Reads one key.
See \fBsample\-config\-get\fR(1).
.TP
\fBconfig set\fR
Sets one key.
See \fBsample\-config\-set\fR(1).
.TP
\fBstats\fR
Shows the savings.
See \fBsample\-stats\fR(1).
.TP
\fBworktree list\fR
Lists the worktrees.
See \fBsample\-worktree\-list\fR(1).
.TP
\fBworktree remove\fR
Removes worktrees.
See \fBsample\-worktree\-remove\fR(1).
